  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "The Worker caste forms the backbone of Skathian society and are responsible for literally all of the building and planning of ships, cities and equipment. They are the craftsman and artists, musicians and tradesmen of their people and without them the entire structure of their civilization would crumble. ",
    "value": "工人阶层构成海鳞族社会的脊梁，几乎负责所有舰船、城市与设备的规划与建造。他们是族中的工匠、艺术家、乐师与商人，若无工人，整个文明架构将顷刻崩塌。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "While looked down upon and mistreated by both of the other castes, the reality is that the Workers are the most important of all. Military and Scientific pursuits are meaningless without the people to manufacture the necessary goods, after all! It is the blood, sweat and tears of the Workers that create.",
    "value": "尽管被其他两个阶层轻视与苛待，工人实为最重要的一环。毕竟，若无人生产必需品，军事与科学追求皆为空谈！一切创造皆源于工人的血汗与泪水。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "Among the castes of the Skath, the Worker is the lowest rung on the totem pole but also enjoys the greatest amount of freedom. While Vanguard are constantly drilling and training for combat and Seekers endlessly look for knowledge, a Worker completes his task and then relaxes and socializes with others of his kind.",
    "value": "在海鳞族各阶层中，工人虽处于图腾柱最底端，却享有最大自由。当先驱不断操练备战、探索者无尽追寻知识时，工人完成指定任务后便可放松，与同族社交。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "This means babies. Lots of babies. Workers outnumber the other castes by a 20-1 ratio, and these numbers are essential if feeding every hungry mouth is to remain a viable goal. It is unfortunate that they are treated as serfs from a pre-industrial society, most barely ekeing out a decent existence on Spawn Worlds. Were they to revolt...they would win by sheer numbers.",
    "value": "这意味着新生儿，大量的新生儿。工人的数量比其他阶层的多二十倍，如果想要让每一张饥饿的嘴都得到满足，这个比例是必不可少的。不幸的是，他们被视为前工业社会的农奴，在繁衍世界勉强维持着体面的生活。但如果他们试图发起革命...他们会将一切都淹没在人民群众的汪洋大海之中。"
  }
